course: dictionary
lesson: 11730
title: Avian: the word for birds
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words are about one group of living things. «Avian» is one of them: it means to do with birds. You can often work it out from the words around it. «The vet who treats sick parrots and owls is an avian vet.» Parrots and owls are birds, so an avian vet must look after birds.
explain: Look at the word parts too. Avian comes from Latin «avis», which means bird. The same root gives us «aviation», the word for flying. If you know that a plane is an aviation machine, you can guess that avian has something to do with birds.
explain: Scientists use avian in lessons and books. «Scientists study avian eggs to learn how baby birds grow.» Here avian means bird-related, so avian eggs are bird eggs. Science words sound posh, but they often just say what a thing is.
fact: Avian means to do with birds.
fact: «Avis» is the Latin word for bird, and avian comes from it.
fact: «Aviation» means flying, and it comes from the same Latin root as avian.
fact: «Avian flu» means bird flu.
fact: Scientists count birds as avian dinosaurs, which are living dinosaurs.
exercise: «The vet who helps sick birds is an avian vet.» What does avian mean? | To do with fish | *To do with birds | To do with trees | To do with the sea
exercise: Avian comes from the Latin word «avis». What does avis mean? | Fish | *Bird | Wing | Egg
exercise: Which of these animals is avian? | *Eagle | Shark | Frog | Lion
test: «The farm checked every hen after the avian flu scare.» What does avian flu mean? | Flu caught from a cold drink | Flu that spreads through trees | *Bird flu | Flu that only affects fish
test: Maya says avian is a science word for birds as a group. Which phrase means that? | Avian volcanoes | *Avian dinosaurs | Avian planets | Avian rivers
exam: Which word means to do with birds? | Canine | Bovine | *Avian | Feline
